{"id":"8113be67baf68252","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-limitlemma.md","title":"Shoenfield极限引理","display":"thm-limitlemma — Shoenfield极限引理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-limitlemma","aliases":["43-thm-limitlemma"],"display":"thm-limitlemma — Shoenfield极限引理","depends_on":["[[43-df-delta02]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-jump]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Lemma 5.6.1 and Theorem 5.6.5(iv), print pp.18–20 / PDF pp.38–40","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-limitlemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-limitlemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-limitlemma — Shoenfield极限引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"801b1a72671fc17a\" href=\"?note=801b1a72671fc17a\" title=\"43-df-delta02\">43-df-delta02</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 5.6.1 and Theorem 5.6.5(iv), print pp.18–20 / PDF pp.38–40"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span>为特征函数。逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 全定义，离散二进制极限即最终常值。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"801b1a72671fc17a\" href=\"?note=801b1a72671fc17a\" title=\"43-df-delta02\">43-df-delta02</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta^0_2\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\Delta^0_2\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow g(x,s)=\\chi_A(x))\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow g(x,s)=\\chi_A(x))\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前向以有限阶段停机集模拟，使用量稳定后正确；反向用停机预言机判断某输入未来是否再变即可取最终值。离散表达避免把不存在的极限当作有值。Δ等价由Post定理或交替量词展开得到。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 5.6.1 and Theorem 5.6.5(iv), print pp.18–20 / PDF pp.38–40。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-delta02","status":"resolved","id":"801b1a72671fc17a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-delta02]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-delta02","status":"resolved","id":"801b1a72671fc17a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-delta02]]、[[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-delta02]]、[[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-delta02]]、[[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-delta02]]、[[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Delta^0_2\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T\\varnothing'.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\le_T\\varnothing'\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow g(x,s)=\\chi_A(x))\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1575,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-limitlemma]] — Shoenfield极限引理"}],"outgoing":["801b1a72671fc17a","f357216a7edb035a","0784d1de3a88cd94","b3936ae4c5d2dc79"]}